========================================================================
WHAT THIS MEANS, IN PLAIN WORDS
========================================================================

YOU MAY:

  * Use Nova to build your mods, including mods you release publicly.
    Anything YOU create with Nova is YOURS. This licence covers Nova
    itself, not the mods you make with it.

  * Share Nova with anyone, for free. Hand it to a friend, mirror the
    installer, link it on a Discord — as long as it is the unmodified
    build and you say where it came from.

YOU MAY NOT:

  * Sell it, put it behind a paywall or a donation wall, bundle it into
    anything paid, or run ads against it. (NonCommercial)

  * Publish a modified version, a fork, a rebrand, or a derivative
    tool built from this code. (NoDerivatives)

  * Republish it stripped of attribution, or in a way that suggests the
    author endorses your version.

  * Distribute a build you have altered — including one with anything
    added to the installer. If you obtained Nova from anywhere other
    than the official releases page, verify it before running it.

